                                <h3>Event Detail</h3>
                                <p>In August 2024, Skillbook Skill Development Centre announced an exciting new partnership with SSC NASSCOM, launching a certification program for Domestic Data Entry Operators. This collaboration provides students with an industry-recognized SSC NASSCOM certificate, highly valued both in India and abroad.
                                    The partnership offers students the opportunity to gain practical skills in data entry operations, enhancing their employability in today’s digital economy. Upon completing the course and certification, students will be well-prepared for job placements, enabling them to earn an income while gaining valuable work experience.
                                    Skillbook's collaboration with SSC NASSCOM reaffirms its commitment to delivering high-quality education that opens up career opportunities for students. This initiative not only supports students in securing jobs but also empowers them with the skills needed to succeed in a competitive global marketplace.
                                    By providing globally recognized certification, Skillbook ensures that students are equipped with the tools they need for financial independence and long-term success in their careers.
                                    </p>
                                <a class="theam_btn btn2 text_white bg_color" href="/#contactIncq">Join Us</a>
